  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets k to 4. If k multiplied by 3 is greater than 10, add 5 to k and store it back. Otherwise, subtract 1 from k and store it back. Then, in a separate if statement, if k is less than 10, subtract 3 from k and store it back. Print the final value of k.",
    "source_code": "k = 4\nif k * 3 > 10:\n    k = k + 5\nelse:\n    k = k - 1\nif k < 10:\n    k = k - 3\nprint(k)\n"
  },
